Subject: [PATCH 46/51] EXPERIMENT: Gate Lunar Lake HDMI VRR timing and
 VTEM-over-GMP test

Disabled by default. Requires native FRL and explicit nonzero HDMI VRR range. Use existing DIP RAM interface to test VTEM transport without guessed MMIO addresses. The modified objects compile, but receiver acceptance, packet timing, and complete VRR behavior are not validated. Not suitable for upstream or general deployment.
